{"type": "json_object", "final": {"answer": "The reserve for product warranties increased by $6 million from 2005 to 2006.", "value": 6, "unit": "millions of dollars", "calculation": "2006 reserve (10) − 2005 reserve (4) = 6", "sources": ["source:q11n3", "source:q11n4"], "result_id": "tool:1", "explanation": "Per the product warranties note, the reserve was $10 million at Dec. 31, 2006 and $4 million at Dec. 31, 2005. The change is 10 − 4 = 6 million."}}